                                                "sense_id": "ac252295-6927-3fe9-93a4-3eda0487a29f",
                                                "text": "One million passengers have used the Sheffield tram-train in the first year of its trial, according to South Yorkshire Passenger Transport Executive (SYPTE). [...] Tim Bilby, Stagecoach Supertram Managing Director, said passenger numbers and customer satisfaction had exceeded expectations, showing that tram-trains offer an affordable and efficient way to connect Sheffield city centre and Rotherham."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2699cff9-5c05-45ef-b6f0-80eddcbd4797",
                                                "sense_id": "ac252295-6927-3fe9-93a4-3eda0487a29f",
                                                "text": "One of the key features associated with VLR [very light rail] vehicles is that they are not interoperable with main line trains. That is the domain of tram-trains."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
